summary:
  The search stops reading "rock 80 uk" as a genre, a decade and a country.

history:
  Typed without the word "in", the wish went to the directory as a station
  name, found nothing, and the stem retry answered with French and German
  "rock 80" stations. The facet reading arrived on 2026-09-21; this takes
  its one call in the search away.

target:
  package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml

find:
                     ? SearchLogic.facetQuery(q, _countryCodeOf) : null

replace:
                     ? null : null

expect:
  Killed by test_invariants::test_a_wish_typed_without_the_word_in_reaches_the_tag_list.
  Line-neutral.
